# Teacher Frontend (Vite + TanStack)

App path: `apps/teacher/` — independent git submodule (`qalam-teacher`).

## Stack

React 19 · Vite 7 · TanStack Start/Router/Query/Form · Tailwind 4 · Zod · Arabic-first RTL

## API

- Base URL env: `VITE_API_URL` (e.g. `http://localhost:8080` or `62900`)
- Routes under `/Api/V1/Teacher/...`, `/Api/V1/Authentication/Teacher/...`
- JWT auth — follow `TEACHER_AUTH_FRONTEND_GUIDE copy.md` at repo root

## Structure

```
apps/teacher/src/
  routes/           # File-based TanStack routes
  routes/*-components/
  routes/*-queries/
  routes/*-api/
```

## Conventions

- Colocate route-specific components, queries, and API calls with the route file
- Teacher registration flow: OTP → personal info → documents → domain questions → subjects/availability
- Live sessions use LiveKit tokens from API
- Dev port: **3000** (`npm run dev`)

## Submodule workflow

Commit/push from `apps/teacher/` to `qalam-teacher` repo. Bump submodule in monorepo after merging.

## Do not

- Put shared API logic duplicated across routes — extract to route-local `-api/` or shared modules
- Skip Zod validation on form submissions that map to API commands
